ui_bugs.issue:
Per-language pill does not increment badge. With French selected, clicking German keeps badge at '1' instead of '2'. With FR+DE+hair_color=Brunette badge shows '2' instead of '3'. Root cause: `isActive(key)` returns boolean true for the entire `languages` array, so ALL_EXTRA_KEYS.filter(isActive).length contributes only +1 from languages no matter how many pills are toggled. Required fix: count array length, not array presence. Suggested formula:
  const baseCount = EXTRA_FILTER_KEYS.filter(isActive).length;
  const langCount = (filters.languages || []).length;
  const activeExtraCount = baseCount + langCount;
OR change isActive to return v.length for arrays and sum the results instead of using .filter(...).length.
